Package: chimera-ai
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ChimeraAI Team <team@chimeraai.dev>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Description: ChimeraAI Desktop Assistant
 ChimeraAI is a powerful desktop AI assistant with dynamic tool system,
 multi-model chat, RAG capabilities, and WebGL games integration.
 .
 Features:
  - Dynamic Python tools with hot-reload
  - Multi-model AI chat (Ollama integration)
  - RAG system with ChromaDB
  - WebGL games library
  - React + TypeScript frontend
  - FastAPI Python backend (bundled)
  - Electron desktop app
 .
 No Python installation required - backend is bundled.
Homepage: https://github.com/yourusername/chimera-ai
